                        <img class="img-fluid" src="https://www.cbq.com.qa/-/media/alternatifbank_beyond_borders_istanbul_01_10_2026_stage_-(205).jpg">

                        <div class="card-contant">
                            <h5>Commercial Bank and Alternatif Bank Support Turkish Companies’ Expansion into the Gulf</h5>
                                <p class="mb-1">
                                    <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-days mx-1"></i>04/10/2026
                                </p>
                            <p><p><strong><span style="line-height: 107%;">Doha, Qatar:</span></strong><span style="line-height: 107%;"> Commercial Bank and Alternatif Bank brought Turkish companies and key regional stakeholders together at &ldquo;Beyond Borders: Empowering Turkish Business in the Gulf Region,&rdquo; held with the support of the Foreign Economic Relations Board of T&uuml;rkiye (DEİK). Senior representatives from National Bank of Oman and United Arab Bank, in which Commercial Bank holds equity stakes, also attended the event, which explored investment, financing and growth opportunities across the Gulf. </span></p></p>
                            <p>

                                <a href="https://www.cbq.com.qa/en/about-us/news/list/commercial-bank-and-alternatif-bank-back-turkish-companies-expansion-in-the-gulf">
Learn More <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
                                </a>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <div class="card mb-4 mt-0">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <img class="img-fluid" src="https://www.cbq.com.qa/-/media/cb---event-coverage-nationalization-award-horizontal.png">

                        <div class="card-contant">
                            <h5>Commercial Bank Receives Leadership Skills Development Award at Qatar Private Sector Nationalization Awards 2026</h5>
                                <p class="mb-1">
                                    <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-days mx-1"></i>01/10/2026
                                </p>
                            <p><p><strong>Doha, Qatar:</strong> Commercial Bank has been recognised with the Excellence Award for Leadership Skills Development at the first edition of the Qatar Private Sector Nationalisation Awards 2026, held by the Ministry of Labour to honour individuals and organisations for their outstanding contributions to national workforce development.</p></p>
                            <p>

                                <a href="https://www.cbq.com.qa/en/about-us/news/list/cbq-receives-leadership-skills-development-award-at-qatar-private-sector-nationalization-awards-2026">
Learn More <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
                                </a>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <div class="card mb-4 mt-0">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <img class="img-fluid" src="https://www.cbq.com.qa/-/media/cb-new-sadara-card-pr.jpg">

                        <div class="card-contant">
                            <h5>Commercial Bank Reimagines Sadara with the New Visa Infinite Credit Card</h5>
                                <p class="mb-1">
                                    <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-days mx-1"></i>30/09/2026
                                </p>
                            <p><p>Commercial Bank has unveiled the new Sadara Visa Infinite Credit Card, marking a new chapter for one of its most established premium banking services. Building on more than two decades of heritage, Sadara has been reimagined around the evolving lifestyles and expectations of today&rsquo;s affluent customers, bringing together a distinctive metal card with an enhanced portfolio of privileges spanning dining, travel, wellness, leisure and entertainment.</p></p>
                            <p>

                                <a href="https://www.cbq.com.qa/en/about-us/news/list/commercial-bank-reimagines-sadara-with-the-new-visa-infinite-credit-card">
Learn More <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
                                </a>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>
